WEBVTT

00:00:05.247 --> 00:00:11.247
Check that the Published tile
counts the videos viewers can watch.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:20.040
Check that the Needs attention
card lists what waits for you.

00:00:22.497 --> 00:00:28.292
Scroll to Recent uploads.

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:34.232
Scroll to Storage used.

00:00:34.482 --> 00:00:40.482
Scroll to Views, last 7 days.

00:00:40.793 --> 00:00:46.793
Click Open in Encoding to go
straight to a video that needs you.

00:00:51.052 --> 00:00:57.052
Choose Dashboard in the
side menu to come back.
